When you complete each round, a statistics screen will appear, and you are awarded points based on the time remaining, how much damage you''ve done, and the number of nitros that are used. One of the options allow you to display the game''s speedometer in either MPH or Km/h. The game also has a storyline, which can be viewed in between rounds.' FROM games WHERE igdb_id = 38422 ON CONFLICT (game_id, language_code) DO NOTHING;

